      "content": "While it's technically possible for hardware with biometric sensors to collect additional data, major companies like Nike and Adidas maintain strict privacy policies to protect their customers. Unauthorized data collection would not only be unethical but also illegal, leading to severe penalties, loss of consumer trust, and reputational damage. If you suspect any foul play, it's best to report such concerns to relevant authorities or directly to the companies involved for clarification.",
